Z||000000||FieroPerformance||10-31-2001||09:57 PM||||I found this picture of a Porsche on <A HREF="http://www.supercars.net" TARGET=_blank>www.supercars.net</A>  and did my best to replace it with a picture I have of my car. My picture was not quite the right angle so I had to do a lot of modification in photoshop.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/porschedriving1.jpg"> <P>Here is the result<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierodriving1.jpg"> <P>I know, I have too much time on my hands.<P>-Charlie<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsigfperformance.jpg"> ||||reg||1
