Z||000009||FieroPerformance||11-01-2001||03:27 PM||||I made the blur behind the car by selecting an area that goes along the road and gets smaller the furthur away from the car it gets. Then I used the gradient tool to fill the selection with red to transparent, after that I used a motion blur to make it less obvious. I think I changed the opacity also.<P>As Tigger said, it is a Carrera GT. Porsche's concept super car. Last time I checked they are going to have a V10 and cost in the area of $375,000? The one I have is a V10 anyway, it is fun to drive, but not very good in the winter.<P>-Charlie<P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/newsigfperformance.jpg"> ||||reg||1
